            "code": "-- Prevent menu access, etc.\nhasFocus = false\n\n-- Set result values\nendingMessage:setValue(\"Map Complete: Mission Success\")\nmappedMessage:setValue(\"100%\")\njewelsMessage:setValue(\"100%\")\ncompleteMessage:setValue(\"100%\")\nscoreMessage:setValue(\"\" .. score:getValue())\n\n-- Pause the game\nequilibria:setPause(true)\ngameTimeLimit:pause()\nif alienContactCount > 0 then\n  sound:pause()\n  damage:pause()\nend\n\n-- Play the ending\nendingSequence:play()"
          },
